      "description": "_verify_relations raises a bare TypeError for a non-boolean pg_inherits child flag (and row[3] an IndexError for a short pg_class row); only the caller verify_base_tables's broad except turns these into a sanitized RlsError, so the fail-closed rule is not expressed by the function itself.",
